Purpose: C++20/libc++ incomplete-type compatibility
Semantic change: none

Adapts the upstream EmptyNamedGrammars() default-argument fix so that
`std::vector<NamedGrammar>` is never constructed while NamedGrammar is still
an incomplete type. Public signatures and object layouts are unchanged.

Apply from the repository root with:
  git apply vendor/xgrammar/patches/0001-cxx20-named-grammar-incomplete-type.patch

